# SOFYEN THEOREM ACADEMIC LICENSE

## Version 1.0 — 2026

Copyright © 2026 Mohamed Sofyen

All rights reserved, subject to the permissions expressly granted below.

This license applies to the original written work, proofs, mathematical
formulations, computational implementations, certificates, source code,
documentation, figures, tables, and other materials published by Mohamed
Sofyen in connection with:

**“Sofyen's Theorem on Universal Non-Ordinarity”**

concerning the genus-3 hyperelliptic family

$$
C_\sigma:\quad y^2=x^7+\sigma x+1.
$$

