## 4. Derivative and Extended Works

A work that modifies, extends, generalizes, translates, or computationally
reimplements the original material must clearly distinguish the new
contribution from the original work.

In particular, a derivative work must not present Mohamed Sofyen's original
proof, formulation, computational certificate, or other original material
as having been independently authored by another person.

A derivative work should state, where appropriate:

> This work builds upon Sofyen's Theorem and/or its original proof and
